      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "For dynamic pages, you can add metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "by not exporting a constant or variable named metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 13.88,
          "en": "but by instead exporting an async function called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.912,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "generateMetadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "And it must be called like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 21.99,
          "en": "because NextJS is also looking for functions like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.99,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "If it doesn't find any other metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "it's checking whether there is such a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 30.75,
          "en": "and if there is such a function, NextJS will execute it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.75,
          "end": 33.21,
          "en": "for you and then it's your job",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 36.483,
          "en": "to return such a metadata object in that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "Now how does that help us with dynamic data?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "Well, this function receives the same data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "our page component receives as props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 52.29,
          "en": "So here we also get an object with a params key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.29,
          "end": 54.9,
          "en": "and that of course allows us to get the meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 57.81,
          "en": "for which the metadata should be generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 61.863,
          "en": "by simply accessing mealSlug and passing that to getMeal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.36,
          "end": 66.54,
          "en": "Well, and with that, we can then return a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "that's set equal to meal title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 73.86,
          "en": "and a description that's set to meal.summary,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.86,
          "end": 77.67,
          "en": "for example, and that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.67,
          "end": 80.973,
          "en": "how we can generate the metadata for a dynamic page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 87.2,
          "en": "With that, if we now visit a meal, we can see its title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 90.753,
          "en": "its name represented here in the tab title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.1,
          "end": 95.13,
          "en": "Now if we enter some invalid slug here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.13,
          "end": 99.53999999999999,
          "en": "we now get an error though instead of the not found page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.53999999999999,
          "end": 102.6,
          "en": "because the metadata is actually generated first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.6,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "and this now simply fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "When I try to access title on meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.13300000000001,
          "en": "that fails because meal is undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 114.213,
          "en": "So therefore we should actually add this if check here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.208,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "where we check whether the meal is maybe not defined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "and called the notFound function if it isn't,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 123.24,
          "en": "inside of generate metadata to ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.24,
          "end": 125.85,
          "en": "that we show the notFound page if generating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.85,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "the metadata fails, which it does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 129.843,
          "en": "if we don't find that meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "With that, you see that now we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 135.243,
          "en": "that meal not found page again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 138.603,
          "en": "but that's how we can handle that metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        }
